WEBVTT

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:04.160
Welcome to our final segment for lesson two.

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:07.800
How do you turn reflection on the past

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.320
into fuel for the future?

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.040
As your player shares insights,

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:15.080
our goal is to make these conversations

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:18.400
relentlessly forward-looking.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.400
We use simple three-step coaching framework

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.040
to make that happen.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.240
Step one, acknowledge the insight.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:29.080
Before you guide, you must validate.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:32.640
Start by saying, that's a powerful realization.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:36.520
This simple step builds trust.

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:41.240
Step number two, connect to the future.

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:44.240
This is key and it's pivotal.

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:46.120
Connect through learnings to the future

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:47.720
and the future actions.

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:50.440
If they identify a strength, ask them,

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:52.360
how can you intentionally use these strengths

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:53.960
to achieve your 90-day goal?

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:58.520
Step three, co-create the future path.

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:00.920
Finally, turn insights into commitment.

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:05.120
Ask, so what's one small action you could take this week

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.120
based on what you've learned?

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:09.480
This builds ownership.

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:13.240
Your play is to prepare your next one-on-one.

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.160
Before the meeting, open your playbook

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:17.760
to the forward-looking framework guide.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:20.320
Use it to script out how you will acknowledge,

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:23.200
connect and co-create with your player.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.720
This concludes lesson two.

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:29.360
In our next lesson, we will introduce the 90-Day Way,

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:31.560
the operating system you will use

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:34.720
to turn these insights into measurable progress.

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:36.120
You've got this.

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:38.040
Now, make it happen.
